"drawer-navigation"><button class="menu-close" aria-label="Close menu">×</button><span class="drawer-label">EXPLORE NITIKSHAM</span><div class="drawer-links"><a href="/">Home</a><details class="drawer-services"><summary>Our expertise <span>+</span></summary><div><a href="/services/">Explore all services</a><a href="/expertise/">Brand & design</a><a href="/expertise-web-development/">Website development</a><a href="/expertise-seo/">SEO</a><a href="/digital-marketing/">Digital marketing</a><a href="/copyright/">Copywriting & content</a><a href="/print/">Print & outdoor</a><a href="/social-media-marketing/">Social media</a></div></details><a href="/about-us/">Our story</a><a href="/team/">The collective</a><a href="/gallery/">Gallery & newsletters</a><a href="/software/">Software studio</a><a href="/login/">Studio login ↗</a><a href="/contact-us/">Contact</a></div><div class="drawer-contact"><span>LET’S CREATE SOMETHING.</span><a href="mailto:contact@nitiksham.com">contact@nitiksham.com</a><a href="tel:+917988567198">+91 79885 67198</a></div></div></dialog><div class="reading-progress" aria-hidden="true"></div><main id="main"><section class="page-head reveal" id="top"><span class="eyebrow">THE NITIKSHAM COLLECTIVE</span><h1>Meet the team. <em>Many perspectives. One creative pulse.</em></h1><p>Designers, strategists, developers and communicators. Different ways of thinking, brought together around your next challenge.</p></section><figure class="image-wrap reveal"><img class="detail-img" src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri()); ?>/assets/img/team-hero.webp" alt="The Nitiksham studio workspace in Karnal — desks, sketches and screens, ready for the next project" width="1200" height="800" decoding="async"><figcaption class="caption">The studio in Karnal — where strategy, design, code and words come together.</figcaption></figure><section class="section"><div class="section-heading"><h2>Meet the minds<br>behind the disciplines.</h2><p>A good idea gets stronger when the right skills work together.</p></div><div class="collective-grid"><article class="reveal"><span>01 / THE COLLECTIVE</span><h3>The strategists</h3><p>Find the question worth answering. Turn business goals into a considered plan — then keep the work honest to it.</p><a href="/digital-marketing/">Explore the discipline <svg class="icon-arrow" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14"/></svg></a></article><article class="reveal"><span>02 / THE COLLECTIVE</span><h3>The designers</h3><p>Give ideas a visual language. Make every brand touchpoint — from a logo to a hoarding — feel connected.</p><a href="/expertise/">Explore the discipline <svg class="icon-arrow" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14"/></svg></a></article><article class="reveal"><span>03 / THE COLLECTIVE</span><h3>The developers</h3><p>Bring the experience to life. Build websites and tools around the people who use them, not around the technology.</p><a href="/expertise-web-development/">Explore the discipline <svg class="icon-arrow" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14"/></svg></a></article><article class="reveal"><span>04 / THE COLLECTIVE</span><h3>The storytellers</h3><p>Find the words and conversations that make a brand feel like itself — on the page, on screen and on social.</p><a href="/copyright/">Explore the discipline <svg class="icon-arrow" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14"/></svg></a></article></div></section><section class="section"><div class="section-heading"><h2>How the collective works</h2></div><div class="two-copy"><p>Nitiksham is a collective, not a department store. A project brings together the disciplines it needs — strategy, design, development and writing — and the people behind them work together on the same brief, from the first conversation to launch.</p><p>That is why the work feels joined up: the person writing your website copy sits beside the person designing it, and the person planning your campaign knows what your brand looks like on a hoarding. One team, one direction — and you always know who to talk to. Read more about the agency on our <a href="/about-us/">story page</a>.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="section-heading"><h2>What we hold to</h2><p>Four disciplines, shared standards — the things every piece of Nitiksham work is measured against.</p></div><div class="values"><article class="reveal"><span>01</span><h3>Strategy before decoration</h3><p>An idea has to be right before it can be beautiful. We ask the awkward questions first — then design the answer.</p></article><article class="reveal"><span>02</span><h3>Craft in the details</h3><p>The kerning, the comma, the loading time: small things are what people notice, even when they cannot name them.</p></article><article class="reveal"><span>03</span><h3>Honest communication</h3><p>Clear about scope, clear about timelines, clear when something is not working. Good work needs straight talking.</p></article></div></section><section class="new-cta"><span class="eyebrow">BETTER TOGETHER</span><h2>Your next idea.<br><em>Our kind of challenge.</em></h2><p>Meet the people who can help bring it to life.</p><a class="button" href="/contact-us/">Start a conversation ↗</a></section></main><footer class="new-footer"><div class="footer-grid"><div><a class="wordmark brand-wordmark" href="/" aria-label="Nitiksham home"><img src="<?php echo esc_url(get_template_directory_uri()); ?>/assets/nitiksham-brand.png" alt="Nitiksham — an idea driven agency" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1239" height="308"></a><p>Strategy, creativity and digital.<br>Different skills. One clear direction.</p></div><div><h3>Explore</h3><a href="/about-us/">About</a><a href="/services/">Expertise</a><a href="/team/">The collective</a><a href="/gallery/">Gallery & newsletters</a></div><div><h3>Say hello</h3><a href="mailto:contact@nitiksham.com">contact@nitiksha